  "about_html": "<h3><strong>About</strong> Rehab Center</h3>\n<p>The average length of time a client is on the detox program is four to five days. This can vary depending on need. Prescription drug users, for example, may average two to three months with community detox as they are weaned off medications on a more gradual basis.</p>\n<div class=\"specialAmenities\">\n<div class=\"specialties\">\n<h4>Specialties</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>12 Step Programs</li>\n<li>Substance Abuse Treatmental</li>\n<li>Residential Drug Rehab</li>\n<li>Intensive Outpatient Program</li>\n<li>Assessment</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"allamenities\">\n<h4>Amenities</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>12 Step Programs</li>\n<li>Substance Abuse Treatmental</li>\n<li>Residential Drug Rehab</li>\n<li>Intensive Outpatient Program</li>\n<li>Assessment</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h4>Therapies</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Holistic Therapy</li>\n<li>Evidence-Based Practices</li>\n<li>Yoga &amp; Meditation</li>\n<li>Individual Therapy &amp; Counseling</li>\n<li>Family Therapy &amp; Counseling</li>\n<li>Group Therapy &amp; Counseling</li>\n<li>Nutritional Counseling</li>\n<li>Art &amp; Nature Therapy</li>\n</ul>",
